"""brief: auto-harvest, plan-brief generator, plan validator, recorder brief builder, and repair brief builder.

Usage:
  brief --harvest [--force]         auto-write .cache/expect/<area>.txt from repo tests and docs
  brief --plan [<area> ...]         write .cache/brief/<area>.plan.md (deterministic code inventory + planner rules)
  brief <area>                      validate .cache/plan/<area>.map.txt (or legacy .cache/behaviors/<area>.txt)
  brief <area> <example>            validate, bin-pack into groups, and write common.md + <area>.<n>.md briefs
  brief --all <example>             same as `brief <area> <example>` for every area that has a plan map
  brief --repair <id> <feature>...  write a slim fresh repair brief .cache/brief/<id>.md for failing features
  brief --repair-all [<feature>...] batch failed features (from .cache/all/failed or args) into repair.<n>.md briefs
  brief --collect [<area>...]       summarize all finished results, traps/defects, and uncovered items of done areas

Shipped by create-project-verification-skill.
"""
